APP_START 把镜像物理地址作为裸值传给 TZ(owner 50/svc 1/cmd 1). 若 TZ
因地址越界拒绝(如 per-device CMA 落在 4GiB 以上), 当前日志没有任何
镜像地址信息可供判断. supp_load_app 里补一行 dev_info, 与 0103 的原始
SMC 返回值对照即可区分地址问题与参数问题. 仅诊断用途, 定位后移除.
---
 drivers/tee/qseecom/core.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/tee/qseecom/core.c b/drivers/tee/qseecom/core.c
index 402ba88..f5dd92c 100644
--- a/drivers/tee/qseecom/core.c
+++ b/drivers/tee/qseecom/core.c
@@ -1518,6 +1518,10 @@ static int qseecom_tee_supp_load_app(struct tee_context *ctx,
 	img_phys = ALIGN(stage_phys, QSEECOM_TEE_IMAGE_ALIGN);
 	aligned = stage + (img_phys - stage_phys);
 
+	dev_info(qtee->dev,
+		 "staging '%s': img_phys=%pap mdt_len=%zu img_len=%zu\n",
+		 app_name, &img_phys, mdt_len, img_len);
+
 	len = qcom_mdt_read_image(qtee->dev, mdt, fw_name, aligned, img_len);
 	if (len < 0)
 		ret = len;
